{"text": "# Vendor master file — change log (Q4)\n\nOwner: Roxanne Villegas-Stout, AP lead, Hollenbeck Property Management, Inc.\nProcedure AP-07: no bank change is made live until a callback to the number **already on file** is logged. System: Yardi Voyager 8.\n\n| Date | Vendor no. | Vendor | Field | Old value | New value | Requested via | Callback / verified by |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 10/02/25 | V00418 | Nnamdi HVAC Services (Ikechukwu Nnamdi, sole prop.) | Tax ID | SSN 857-48-6718 | EIN 93-4471208 | new Form W-9 by email | n/a — RVS |\n| 10/09/25 | V00233 | Pfeffer & Sons Roofing LLC | Bank | Brazoria Gulf Bank, ABA 118200886, acct 0044187725 | Cypress Bend Credit Union, ABA 119830695, acct 77100492 | letter on letterhead | Called Gerald Pfeffer at 979-555-0144, 10/10 9:20. Confirmed. — RVS |\n| 10/21/25 | V00507 | Suda's Cleaning Crew (Suda Wongsakul) | Address | 1420 Avenue H, Lot 6, Rosenberg TX 77471 | 88 Mulberry Field Ln, Richmond TX 77406 | phone | Spoke with Suda in person at the Lake Jackson office. — RVS |\n| 11/03/25 | V00418 | Nnamdi HVAC Services | Bank | Cypress Bend Credit Union, acct ending 3310 | Trinity Bayou National Bank, ABA 117568095, acct 5120044871 | vendor portal, user inamdi.hvac | **REJECTED — see below** |\n| 11/05/25 | V00418 | Nnamdi HVAC Services | Portal password | — | reset; temp password Tmp-7Qx!4418 given by phone | phone | Ike confirmed identity with last 4 of EIN. — RVS |\n\n## 11/03 rejected change — notes for Travis\n\n- The portal request came in at 02:14 from IP 198.51.100.77. Every earlier login for this vendor was from 203.0.113.140 (his shop in Angleton).\n- The portal user name is **inamdi.hvac**; the real one is innamdi.hvac. Somebody registered a look-alike account on 10/30 using ike@nnamdi-hvac-services.example, not his real address, ike@nnamdihvac.example.\n- I called Mr. Nnamdi on the number on file, (979) 555-0171. He has not changed banks. He says his email was hacked in October and that he had sent an invoice with his voided check to another customer.\n- Our next ACH to him would have been $18,440.00 on November 7 (invoices NH-2291 and NH-2304). Held and reissued to the old account.\n- I have not told the bank yet. Travis Hollenbeck to decide whether we report it; our cyber policy is no. CYB-0091844.\n- Side note: Ike mentioned he is waiting on his citizenship oath ceremony and is worried a fraud report with his name on it will cause him trouble. I told him he is the victim here.", "kind": "Markdown document", "detail": "439 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Roxanne Villegas-Stout", "Gerald Pfeffer", "Ikechukwu Nnamdi", "Suda Wongsakul", "Ike", "inamdi", "Travis Hollenbeck", "Mr. Nnamdi"], "companies": ["Hollenbeck Property Management", "Yardi Voyager", "Brazoria Gulf Bank", "Cypress Bend Credit Union", "Trinity Bayou National Bank", "nnamdi-hvac-services", "nnamdihvac", "example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Rosenberg", "Richmond", "Lake Jackson", "Angleton"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["SSN", "EIN", "citizenship oath ceremony", "fraud report"], "names": ["Roxanne", "Ikechukwu", "Gerald", "Suda", "Travis", "Ike", "Nnamdi"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999552965164, "modelMs": 25645.5, "topicMs": 24856.70000000298, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 47, "end": 69, "text": "Roxanne Villegas-Stout", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Roxanne Villegas-Stout"}, {"start": 80, "end": 116, "text": "Hollenbeck Property Management, Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Hollenbeck Property Management, Inc."}, {"start": 232, "end": 245, "text": "Yardi Voyager", "kind": "person", "sou